          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "<div style=\"font:13px/1.55 Inter,Roboto,sans-serif;color:#c7d0d9\"><div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#e6edf3;margin-bottom:4px\">NVLink &amp; NVSwitch &mdash; area home</div><div style=\"color:#8b98a5;margin-bottom:8px\">Entry point for the NVLink boards. This page carries one dataset only: every open NVLink-area worklist item right now, GPU side and switch side in one list. Sources are the tray textfile collector (<code>su1_nvlink_*</code>, <code>su1_service_active</code>) and the out-of-band switch-firmware sweep (<code>job=switch-fw</code>). Every other NVLink number lives on exactly one of the boards below and is deliberately not repeated here.</div><div style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#8b98a5\">NVLink area&nbsp;&rsaquo;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#e6edf3;font-weight:600\">Area home</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/d/nvis-nvlink-downlanes/?${__url_time_range}\" style=\"color:#6ea8fe;text-decoration:none\">NVLink lanes &amp; IMEX &mdash; per tray</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/d/nvis-nvswitch-fleet/?${__url_time_range}\" style=\"color:#6ea8fe;text-decoration:none\">NVSwitch fleet &mdash; reachability &amp; firmware</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/d/nvis-nvswitch-health/?${__url_time_range}\" style=\"color:#6ea8fe;text-decoration:none\">NVSwitch health &mdash; fabric plane &amp; churn</a></div></div>",
