    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "nvis-victoriametrics"
      },
      "description": "Every open NVLink-area item right now, in five disjoint classes: a tray publishing no NVLink lane telemetry, a tray enumerating fewer than 72 lanes, a tray with nvidia-imex inactive, an NVSwitch the out-of-band sweep cannot reach, and a reachable NVSwitch reporting unhealthy. The two tables beside and below are built from the identical five expressions \u2014 the class column sums to this number and the item table has exactly this many rows.",
